WEBVTT

00:07:30.112 --> 00:07:31.238
Two:

00:07:31.280 --> 00:07:34.200
Do not touch anyone's toys
without permission.

00:07:34.658 --> 00:07:37.870
If you're not sure
if something is a toy, ask.

00:07:38.746 --> 00:07:39.955
Three:

00:07:39.997 --> 00:07:44.460
Consent can be withdrawn
at any time during an activity.

00:07:45.586 --> 00:07:47.338
And my personal favorite:

00:07:47.379 --> 00:07:49.673
if consent is not given,

00:07:49.715 --> 00:07:51.800
do not ask again.

00:07:52.134 --> 00:07:54.553
Accept and respect a "no,"

00:07:54.595 --> 00:07:56.931
as graciously as you would a "yes."

00:07:56.972 --> 00:08:02.019
(Applause)